<description>&lt;p&gt;Syria has confirmed dispatching troops to Saudi Arabia to fight the Houthis while denying any deployment to Yemen. Jordan and Syria have deepened cooperation, signing eleven agreements covering economic projects, security coordination and a rail link, with officials saying bilateral ties are at their strongest in decades. Heavy clashes have erupted in the Damascus countryside around Wadi Barada. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOUEhjZmszU2dGSUdrdmhET1BLVGhsWTdfWnhVdlRKLUxJTXIyYWpEaVNub29udXVLVzNPUjlfaDJFOU5ORUxrazdPbGZhTjY1TS1yUWRyaW9XZnFibU0xNTJCbDJhNXF4TWtUQ1F2REJreEpvY3RTRXFxOWNjMFNUM0FOdXA1eXRicHgzY0wxcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;TVC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNblcxNmEtNGhBdjc4aGNsQzl6XzJ4czRfT0d5S2loc3lmODh3Y3lpbFF1emhrQmFYMlR5YUpYRDVuWGtQbHAtWXlVMWZvakVKRFZpeTN3bEhRbHpCR2NUZGU0Ti1iVWtCbENiZWt2YVhLQ0dTVU84eGljbHRSaU04QlVoLXI5TEUzeW0zN2dYd1hXWjZnd1VFMkp3MXJnelo4N29vU3VzQjdyUUFwQjQ4Qno5bGVaZHB1?oc=5&quot;&gt;MEMRI | Middle East Media Research Institute&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxNaE1EN1JmdlpmQzd6cE5kSVVwNVZ0X3RqOXg5dG5sWmtTZEh4SDdIRXhvZWgwY01HcG8tUjFTSnFUVGlIVTdQaDduM2N0MXR5bTZvdlpIQkdoNmpqalRtV2QtLV90RmFsM19OT29oSU1hOWU3eVJFVTFmZ3B0dURMLTZkQW9pQi1WNmZVNTEwa1JHMVZZc0UxV1Z3U3V2NUYzbERjdEpNRTZNRTVMd0JVOHZMZmZpdUZkdmIxTTQ4MGNjZG1ZSDQzdnhzZUwzQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Syrian Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPUnRhZHVKTVRTNkZrR3o1al9OSk9XbkpHbFZsY2lSVjl2QXJGY0tiZzRVX0g3SmdhMFR5N0VyN0hsM1dMVEZKTkhES0hsczRO